 "lines": "I want my soul now to imagine my body. / Let's watch strangers collide & spark electric currents that gamut the mood— a good one. / We want him to be the last one to leave, / prolonging the bitter refraction from the escape— / inside the walls of an escape that few pleasures offer us.",
